<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= error.status || 500 %> - Terjadi Kesalahan | SkillSphere AI</title>
  
  <!-- PWA Manifest & App Icons -->
  <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#1F1E1B">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
  
  <!-- Google Fonts: Newsreader (Editorial Serif) & Plus Jakarta Sans -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;1,6..72,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <!-- Font Awesome 6 Icons -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  
  <!-- Claude Design System Stylesheet -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/claude-theme.css?v=2.1">

  <style>
    .error-page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 24px;
      background-color: var(--bg-app);
    }

    .error-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      max-width: 1040px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .error-main {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }

    .error-card {
      max-width: 600px;
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      padding: 44px 36px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-floating);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .error-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 5px 14px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      background: var(--color-danger-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-danger);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-danger);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .error-code {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 72px;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .error-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .error-desc {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
  </style>

  <script>
    (function() {
      const savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('skillsphere_theme') || 
        (window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light');
      document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', savedTheme);
    })();
  </script>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="error-page">
    <header class="error-header">
      <a href="/" class="brand-logo" style="text-decoration: none;">
        <div class="brand-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
            <path opacity="0.38" d="M12 7.6L17.3 4.7L14.4 10L17.3 15.3L12 12.4L6.7 15.3L9.6 10L6.7 4.7Z" />
            <path d="M12 0L13.8 8.2L22 10L13.8 11.8L12 20L10.2 11.8L2 10L10.2 8.2L12 0Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span>SkillSphere AI</span>
      </a>
    </header>

    <main class="error-main">
      <div class="error-card">
        <div class="error-badge">
          <i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
          <span>Status <%= error.status || 500 %></span>
        </div>

        <div class="error-code"><%= error.status || 500 %></div>
        <h1 class="error-title"><%= message || 'Terjadi Gangguan pada Server' %></h1>
        <p class="error-desc">
          Sistem sedang mengalami kendala saat memproses permintaan ini. Silakan coba beberapa saat lagi atau kembali ke halaman beranda.
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline">
            <i class="fas fa-house"></i> Beranda Utama
          </a>
          <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary">
            <i class="fas fa-compass"></i> Buka Dashboard
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer style="text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-tertiary);">
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> SkillSphere AI</p>
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
